{"3153130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Element Warriors", "steam_appid": 3153130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <i>Five Elements Warriors</i>, you will step onto a strategic battlefield where every move requires wisdom and foresight. The battlefield is more than just a chessboard—it's an arena filled with tactical depth and strategic competition. Set in a fantastical continent, you will gather companions, explore the unknown, and embark on a mission to save the world, experiencing thrilling and challenging turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deployment:</strong> Carefully position your units in each battle, leveraging terrain, enemy weaknesses, and unique abilities to craft your tactics. Every move counts, and clever strategy will determine the outcome of the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Units:</strong> The game features a wide array of units, each with distinct skills and attributes. Adapt your lineup to the needs of each encounter and build your ultimate team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment and Skills:</strong> Through combat and exploration, you'll acquire powerful equipment and skills to enhance your units. Smart combinations of gear and abilities will give your team the edge in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Storyline:</strong> Immerse yourself in a deep narrative and captivating quests. As you complete missions and explore the world, you'll uncover the hidden secrets of the continent and embark on a gripping adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers multiple unique characters, allowing players to freely customize their lineup and equip diverse gear. With a rich talent system supporting various development paths, <i>Five Elements Warriors</i> caters to all kinds of strategic preferences.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of <i>Five Elements Warriors</i>, you will step onto a strategic battlefield where every move requires wisdom and foresight. The battlefield is more than just a chessboard—it's an arena filled with tactical depth and strategic competition. Set in a fantastical continent, you will gather companions, explore the unknown, and embark on a mission to save the world, experiencing thrilling and challenging turn-based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deployment:</strong> Carefully position your units in each battle, leveraging terrain, enemy weaknesses, and unique abilities to craft your tactics. Every move counts, and clever strategy will determine the outcome of the battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Units:</strong> The game features a wide array of units, each with distinct skills and attributes. Adapt your lineup to the needs of each encounter and build your ultimate team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment and Skills:</strong> Through combat and exploration, you'll acquire powerful equipment and skills to enhance your units. Smart combinations of gear and abilities will give your team the edge in battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Storyline:</strong> Immerse yourself in a deep narrative and captivating quests. As you complete missions and explore the world, you'll uncover the hidden secrets of the continent and embark on a gripping adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers multiple unique characters, allowing players to freely customize their lineup and equip diverse gear. With a rich talent system supporting various development paths, <i>Five Elements Warriors</i> caters to all kinds of strategic preferences.</p>", "short_description": "A turn-bas